WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.230
The conditions to the Hero's returning

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.150
To think that our hero, who 
tried so hard for everyone,

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:15.900
That's just crazy!

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.580
I don't want a sad good bye!

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.530
The Promise

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.420
I can't eat anymore...

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.160
How many days is it 
until summer vacation?

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.450
Um, in earth days, today is April 4 so...

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.670
...a little over 100 days.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.030
100 days...

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.180
it's too bad we won't see 
each other for so long.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:44.670
But, I can stay for two or three days

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.000
...and you can summon me 
if there's an emergency!

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.150
Yes... Thank you, Sink.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.860
Um, Princess.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.150
Of course!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:05.010
We have to have a proper 
ceremony to send you off.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:08.930
Sink, the hero of Biscotti has completed

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.080
the role he was summoned for...

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.790
...and will be returning home today.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.270
Please hand the hero's sword,
the divine sword Palladion

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:47.410
A little more... just a little more...

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.870
Just a little bit more,
I want you to wait a bit more...

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.880
How to prevent a sad 
farewell with our hero...

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.630
If I turn this page...

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:05.570
...I might be able to find it...

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.290
So just a little more...

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:11.890
Rico...

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.030
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.330
-Rico...
-I couldn't find it...

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:31.400
I'm not good enough after all...

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.540
That's not true...

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.840
Rico...

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:39.460
you tried so hard.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.890
I might not be able to take

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.540
any of my memories with me...

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.900
...but I still think I won't forget...

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:49.430
I'll remember.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.250
Hero...

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.130
Oh, right...

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:58.230
I have a present for you, Rico... Here.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:02.790
A four color ballpoint pen... 
and a portable speaker.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.630
I can't give you my cell phone...

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.120
Take them apart...

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.630
Always... always...

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.870
Thank you, Rico...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.770
Really, I have to watch 
over you to the end?

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.830
Don't say that.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:42.830
The Princess is already preparing

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:45.630
to send you home
at the summoning stage...

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:48.530
...we don't have much more time...

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.480
Right...

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:53.440
Oh... Um, Eclair...

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:56.120
This is used, but...

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.360
Uh, sure, I'll keep it for you.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:04.760
Thanks.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:07.410
You've been handing out a bunch

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:09.210
of stuff to everyone, haven't you?

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.140
Yeah.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.890
I gave Countess Dalkian and 
the Leader of the Knights

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:18.020
I gave Yukki the strap I 
had on my cell phone...

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:22.930
It's like you're giving everyone a keepsake.
I don't like it...

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.280
Really?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.220
Yeah.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:30.910
I guess...

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.210
Once you go home, you can't 
come back to Flonyald.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:40.730
Yeah.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:45.380
Looks like I'm even going 
to lose my memory...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.110
When did you realize?

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.230
Anyone can tell from watching Rico.

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:54.930
I see...

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.440
But, I heard that it was 
really easy to come here...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:02.190
so you wouldn't think that going 
back would be like this...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.320
It's stupid.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.820
Well, I won't forget.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.190
Everything that happened in Flonyald...

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.350
...the Chief who has a short temper and

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.830
kicks me all the time but 
is strong and true...

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.440
The time I spent with you, Eclair.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.490
I...

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:28.300
I'm not confident I'll remember you.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.430
I'm busy everyday...
with training and

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.350
battles and foreign relations...

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.230
That's sad to hear...

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:40.260
If you're sad to be forgotten...

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.560
If you don't want to be forgotten...

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:50.070
...no matter what happens,
don't you dare forget about us!

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:55.070
And... try to get back soon!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.440
Right... I will!

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.680
Sink...

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:22.980
Princess.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:30.550
Hey Tatsumaki, you are here too?

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.280
Yes... She wanted to see you off.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.580
Really.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:43.190
When I send him home,
only me and Sink can stay here...

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:47.120
Tatsumaki, say your goodbye to Sink now.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.630
Yes...
Tatsumaki, thank you.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:59.260
While I was waiting
I finished preparing for the ceremony.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:05.090
When it's time,
you will rise up to the sky from here...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.350
...and return to your world.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.340
I see...

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:23.040
It was only just a while 
ago that you came to us...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.370
...but it feels like a long time ago...

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.620
Yes...

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:32.130
I met you here, and 
you became our hero...

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.830
...and a lot has happened...

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:40.760
But it was fun having you 
here, being with you!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.850
It was lots of fun!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:52.730
It was fun for me, too!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.390
Being summoned here to Biscotti and

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.780
But it's okay...

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.610
next time during summer vacation!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.170
I will come back!

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:12.980
Next time... we'll have 
more fun, much more fun!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.920
Sink...

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.500
No, don't... don't cry...

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:26.130
We won't forget you of 
course... and Sink...

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.690
...you won't forget us either.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:33.520
I won't!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.400
I promise... I will never forget you!

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:00.300
Well then... Princess...

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.480
Sink...

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.190
Sink, Sink...!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.990
No! I don't want you to leave!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:24.640
Princess...

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:30.370
No... I want to be with you more, Sink!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.720
I do too, I want to be with you,

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.490
I love you, Sink...

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:44.010
I... Millefi loves you Sink,

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.390
forever and ever!!

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:49.310
Princess... I...!

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:57.150
I...!

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.150
Sink!!!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:03.160
Princess!!
I love you, too!

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:06.740
So I will come back, I will!!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.120
I'll come to see you...

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.620
I promise you!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:43.180
Sink!!!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.200
Sink! Are you up?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.810
Sink.

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.730
I'm coming in!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.840
Excuse me...

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.400
Becky.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.380
Oh, you're up.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.640
You should say something if you're up...

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.370
What?
Did you just get up?

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:10.640
Sink?

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.560
What? What happened?

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.150
Are you hurt?

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.230
Um, so to sum it up... 
it's something like this?

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:27.690
The two weeks of spring break,
you know you went somewhere...

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.120
...but you can't remember where you went.

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:31.370
Right.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:35.410
But, it feels like something 
very sad happened.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.210
That's right.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:46.750
Uh... Memory loss, bumped head...

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.220
No way! 84,000 hits?!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:51.970
Uh, you don't have to 
search on the Internet.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:59.280
It's just... I just can't remember...

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:02.610
Really? Do you want 
to go to the hospital?

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.180
I think you should get 
yourself checked out.

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:07.580
No, no... I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.990
And there's the trip...

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.990
Should I call your mom and dad?

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:16.500
Thanks, Becky... but really, I'm fine.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:19.500
Let's eat breakfast and go out!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.850
I don't know,

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.100
Well, they say with sudden amnesia,

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.770
I hope so...

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:45.780
Really...

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:50.160
I was just a regular kid
in my first year of junior high...

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:55.490
And next to me was my kind 
and good friend Becky...

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.350
And once spring break is over,

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:05.250
Sink! Becky!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:10.010
My relative and master... 
and rival, Nanami...

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:12.370
How've you been!

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.770
Is that how you greet someone
you haven't met in a while?!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.070
Nanami, I can't breathe...

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.530
Stop it!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.130
Nanami, you haven't changed a bit.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.360
My father, the oceanographer

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:45.560
I haven't forgotten any of that...

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:49.140
But what is it?

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.680
What, I can too!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.970
It felt like I had forgotten 
something really important...

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:02.610
...like something really 
special was missing...

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.560
...a sense of worry...

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.620
Noir?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.620
Sorry. Did I wake you?

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.660
No, I'm fine.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.970
I didn't think that Sink going

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.630
home would be such a big deal...

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.390
I should have noticed...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:38.390
But it was what the Hero wanted.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.390
This... it's a book about summoning

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.060
that I got from the Galette library.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.180
Thank you!

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.070
A letter?

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:52.320
Uh... this seal... isn't 
it a Biscotti seal?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.070
To royal researchers,
Subject: Summoning of a hero

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.160
"Precautionary notes to sending home

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.530
a hero that was summoned..."

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:10.410
"This method should be used only..."

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:13.660
"...when the hero has refused 
to hold proper interaction

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:19.250
"In such cases, the 
hero cannot take home

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:22.730
anything
from Flonyald including his memory."

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:32.280
"However, this memory is 
not immediately lost...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:40.020
"...it is locked and it takes 
about half a year for the

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.580
memory to be completely lost."

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.790
"Therefore, if a hero
who was sent home

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.720
is to be once again summoned..."

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:50.340
"...the following 
conditions must be met."

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:54.620
"First, more than 91 days must pass

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.420
"Second, the hero himself must have

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.410
promised at least three people..."

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.890
"...other than the summoner

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:12.280
"...and he must have left an item
that he had on his person."

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:15.820
"The item can be anything..."

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.840
"...but it's better be 
something brought over

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:20.570
from the world the hero 
originally came from."

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.190
"Third..."

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.950
Princess, Princess...

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.420
I'm sorry to bother you so early!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.260
Rico... what is it?

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:36.960
Princess!

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:41.050
Did you receive anything from the hero?

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.240
Yes... after the ceremony...

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:47.630
Sink told me to open it after 
he returned to his world...

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.840
What is it?

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.690
I haven't...

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.170
Please open it!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.690
It might be... It just might be...!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:58.510
Yes...

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.450
"To the summoner..."

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:04.500
"...the hero must provide an

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.950
item of commitment
and a promise document..."

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:11.420
"The promise document must 
state a promise to return..."

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:15.210
"...as well as
the full names of the hero and the summoner."

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:20.720
"Dear Princess Millefiore 
Filliano Biscotti..."

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.230
"...from your Hero Sink Izumi,

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:30.810
"P.S. I will return once 
again as your hero,

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:33.730
Rico?!

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.230
Yay!!

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.230
Princess, this will work!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.910
Really?

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:52.670
Yes... the hero... he kept his promise!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.180
Oh, Sink...

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:46.010
Becky!!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.690
Becky!! Becky! Becky! Becky!!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.980
-Hey, Sink! Sink!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.450
Becky!

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:59.750
What? What is it?

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.750
I remember...! I remember everything!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.030
Oh, really?

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.750
It was really fun!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.790
I made lots of friends, too!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.080
Really...

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.050
Let's go there together, this summer!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:20.090
Uh... sure, if I can go why not.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.010
Sink, Becky!!

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:26.060
What are you two doing!

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.620
Let me in!

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:28.700
Sure!

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.410
-Huh? What?
-Yah!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:44.020
That spring break before my 
second year of junior high...

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:51.790
Summer vacation I will 
return to that place...

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:55.000
...and become a hero again!

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:40.100
<b>Thank you for watching!</b>
